00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
An article. An image. A video. Before you decide what to trust, take a closer look.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:14,600
Meet AIDetector.cx—a platform for examining AI-generated content and reviewing the signals behind the results.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Start with your text. Run an analysis, explore the highlighted signals, and review the explanation alongside the score. Use the findings to guide your next step.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:36,800
Explore Balanced and Aggressive analysis modes, and understand how their assessments differ. A detection result supports your judgment; it does not establish authorship.

5
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:47,200
Go beyond text with plagiarism checking and image and video analysis. Review available evidence and understand where further verification is needed.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,600
For study, publishing, or everyday content review, bring more context to your decisions.

7
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,500
Before you trust it, check it. Explore AIDetector.cx.
